---
/**
 * Footer compatto a 3 blocchi per Brilla Cafe.
 * Blocco 1: Brand | Blocco 2: Dove & Quando | Blocco 3: Contatti & WhatsApp.
 */
---

<footer class="bg-brand-dark text-white/80 pt-12 pb-10 border-t border-brand-dark/20 mt-20">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-10 mb-10">
      
      {/* Blocco 1: Brand */}
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3.5">
          <img
            src="/logo.jpeg"
            alt="Brilla Cafe Logo"
            class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl object-cover shadow-xl border-2 border-white/25 flex-shrink-0"
          />
          <div>
            <span class="text-xl font-black tracking-tight text-white block leading-tight">
              Brilla <span class="text-brand-cyan font-bold">Cafe'</span>
            </span>
            <span class="text-xs text-white/60 uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold">
              Bar · Cartoleria · Edicola
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      {/* Blocco 2: Dove & Quando */}
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider">Dove Siamo & Orari</h4>
        <div class="text-xs text-white/70 space-y-2">
          <p>📍 Via Umberto I, 35 – 26843 Castelnuovo Bocca d'Adda (LO)</p>
          <div class="space-y-1">
            <p><strong class="text-white font-medium">Lunedì – Sabato:</strong> 06:30 – 19:30</p>
            <p><strong class="text-white font-medium">Domenica:</strong> 07:00 – 13:00</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      {/* Blocco 3: Contatti & WhatsApp */}
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider">Assistenza Rapida</h4>
        <p class="text-xs text-white/70">
          Hai bisogno di informazioni su un articolo o vuoi fare una richiesta su misura?
        </p>
        <div class="pt-1">
          <a
            href="https://wa.me/393500206743?text=Ciao%20Brilla%20Cafe%E2%80%99,%20vorrei%20informazioni%20su%20un%20prodotto"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2.5 bg-[#25D366] hover:bg-[#20ba59] text-white text-xs font-bold rounded-xl transition-all shadow-sm focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-white"
          >
            <span>💬 Scrivici su WhatsApp</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    {/* Bottom bar */}
    <div class="pt-6 border-t border-white/10 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-xs text-white/40">
      <p>
        © {new Date().getFullYear()} Brilla SAS di Bricchi Sara e c. · P.IVA 11824030966
      </p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-5">
        <a href="/privacy" class="hover:text-white transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-white rounded-sm px-1">Privacy Policy</a>
        <a href="/cookie" class="hover:text-white transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-white rounded-sm px-1">Cookie Policy</a>
        <a href="/admin" class="hover:text-brand-cyan text-white/50 transition-colors flex items-center gap-1 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-brand-cyan rounded-sm px-1">
          <span>🔒 Area Riservata</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</footer>
